      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\t<head>\n\n  <title>Samba - opening windows to a wider world</title>\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://www.samba.org/samba/news.atom\" type=\"application/atom+xml\" title=\"Samba News\">\n\t\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/samba/style/2010/grey/favicon.ico\">\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\"\n\t\t href=\"/samba/style/2010/grey/screen.css\">\n\t\t<!--[if lte IE 7]>\n\t\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\"\n\t\t\t href=\"style/screenFixIE7.css\">\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\"\n\t\t href=\"/samba/style/2010/grey/print.css\">\n\n\t\t<meta http-equiv=\"Content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n\t\t<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Language\" content=\"en-us\">\n\t\t<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Samba SMB CIFS\">\n\t\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Home of Samba, the SMB file server\">\n  \t\t<!-- include any JavaScript required here -->\n\t</head>\n\t<body>\n\t\t<div id=\"pageStart\">\n\t\t\t<!-- header -->\n\t\t\t<div id=\"hd\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"noPrint\" id=\"hdScreen\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bannerStart\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<form action=\"https://duckduckgo.com\" method=\"get\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"searchString\">search samba.org:</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" class=\"text\" id=\"searchString\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" src=\"/samba/style/2010/grey/buttonSearch.png\" class=\"image\" id=\"searchButton\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"sites\" value=\"samba.org\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearing\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"noScreen\" id=\"hdPrint\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/samba/style/2010/grey/headerPrint.jpg\" alt=\"Samba\" id=\"hdPrintImage\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearing\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- main content -->\n\t\t\t<div id=\"bd\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bdCols\">\n\n<!-- left column: navigation -->\n<div class=\"noPrint\" id=\"nav\">\n\t<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"/samba/\">Home</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\t<br>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/what_is_samba.html\">think Samba</a></li>\n\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/download/\">get Samba</a></li>\n\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/docs/\">learn Samba</a></li>\n\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/archives.html\">talk Samba</a></li>\n\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/devel/\">hack Samba</a></li>\n\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/team/\">contact Samba</a></li>\n\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/samba/support/\">support Samba</a></li>\n\n\t</ul>\n</div>\n\n<!-- center column: content -->\n<div id=\"mainStart\">\n\n<!--- TODO: do we want this? <div id=\"content\"> -->\n\n\n\n<br />\n<br />\n\n<h2>Where is Steve?</h2>\n\n<img src=\"/samba/images/lsfmm-french-sm.jpg\"\n     alt=\"Steve French\"\n     width=\"140\"\n     height=\"185\"\n     style=\"float:left; margin-right:20px; margin-bottom:10px\">\n\n<p>On August 22, 2026, the Samba team lost a member and dear friend,\n<a href=\"https://www.samba.org/~sfrench/\"> Steve French</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Steve devoted so much of his life to the SMB community, and his\nfriendliness and respect for others guided and encouraged countless\npeople.</p>\n\n<p>We feel blessed to have known him as a friend and colleague over\nthe decades. We miss him, and our hearts are with his family.</p>\n\n<p>Peace to you, Steve.</p>\n\n<br />\n<br />\n\n<h2>Opening Windows to a Wider World</h2>\n\n<p>\n\nSamba is the most feature-rich Open Source implementation of the SMB\nand Active Directory protocols for Linux and UNIX-like systems.\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\nSamba provides secure, stable and fast file and print services for all clients\nusing SMB and other AD protocols such as LDAP and Kerberos.\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\nSamba is a high-performance, scalable distributed software for providing\naccess to various cluster filesystems. It enables cloud platform-as-a-service (PaaS)\nproviders, software-defined storage (SDS) solutions, high-performance\ncomputing (HPC) applications, and enterprise-grade network attached storage\n(NAS) to support the latest security and SMB capabilities.\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\nSamba is an important component to seamlessly integrate Linux/Unix\nServers and Desktops into Active Directory environments. It can function either\nas an Active Directory Domain Controller or as a member server.\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\nSamba is developed, maintained and supported by an active worldwide community.\nDevelopment work is made possible by individuals, companies, customers and\nfunds like the <a href=\"https://www.sovereign.tech\">Sovereign Tech Fund</a>.\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\nSamba is <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.html\"\ntarget=\"_blank\">Free Software</a> licensed under the <a\nhref=\"/samba/docs/GPL.html\">GNU General Public License</a>, the Samba project\nis a member of the <a href=\"https://www.sfconservancy.org/\"\ntarget=\"_blank\">Software Freedom Conservancy</a>.\n\n</p>\n\n\n<!-- bottom boxes -->\n<div class=\"mainBox\" id=\"mainBoxReleases\">\n\t<h3>Releases</h3>\n\t<div class=\"mainBoxContent\">\n\t\t<!-- BEGIN: box_releases.html -->\n<h5>Current stable release</h5>\n<!-- BEGIN: generated_news/latest_stable_release.html -->\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/stable/samba-4.25.1.tar.gz\">Samba 4.25.1 (gzipped)</a><br>\n<a href=\"/samba/history/samba-4.25.1.html\">Release Notes</a> &middot;\n<a href=\"https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/stable/samba-4.25.1.tar.asc\">Signature</a>\n</p>\n<!-- END: generated_news/latest_stable_release.html -->\n\n\n<h5>Release History</h5>\n<p>\n\t<a href=\"/samba/history/\">Versions &amp; Notes</a>\n</p>\n\n<h5>Maintenance</h5>\n<p>\n\t<a href=\"/samba/patches/\">Patches</a> &middot;\n\t<a href=\"/samba/history/security.html\">Security Updates</a> &middot;\n\t<a href=\"/samba/ftp/samba-pubkey.asc\">GPG Key</a>\n</p>\n\n<h5>Future</h5>\n<p>\n\t<a href=\"https://wiki.samba.org/index.php/Samba_Release_Planning\">Release Planning</a> &middot;\n\t<a href=\"https://wiki.samba.org/index.php/Roadmap\">Roadmap</a>\n</p>\n<!-- END: box_releases.html -->\n\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"mainBoxBottom\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mainBox\" id=\"mainBoxBeyondSamba\">\n\t<h3>Beyond Samba</h3>\n\t<div class=\"mainBoxContent\">\n\t\t<!-- BEGIN: box_beyond_samba.html -->\n<h5>Commercial Support</h5>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/samba/support/globalsupport.html\">Global</a>\n&middot;\n<a href=\"/samba/support/\">By Country</a>\n</p>\n\n<h5>Conferences</h5>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.sambaxp.org/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/samba/images/sambaxp-small.png\" alt=\"sambaXP\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" target=\"_blank\"></a>\nby\n<a href=\"https://www.sernet.com/\" target=\"_blank\">SerNet</a>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://storagedeveloper.org/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/samba/images/sdc-logo.png\" alt=\"SDC\" width=\"100\" height=\"25\" target=\"_blank\"></a>\nby\n<a href=\"https://www.snia.org\" target=\"_blank\">SNIA</a>\n</p>\n<!-- END: box_beyond_samba.html -->\n\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"mainBoxBottom\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearing\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- right column: specials -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"noPrint\" id=\"special\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBox\"\tid=\"specialBoxDonations\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxContent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Donations</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNowadays, the Samba Team\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tneeds a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"//www.samba.org/samba/donations.html\">dollar</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinstead of pizza ;-)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxBottom\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBox\" id=\"specialBoxNews\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxContent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- BEGIN: posted_news/20261023-153430.4.25.1.body.html -->\n<h5><a name=\"4.25.1\">23 October 2026</a></h5>\n<p class=headline>Samba 4.25.1 Available for Download</p>\n<p>\nThis is the first stable release of the Samba 4.25 release series.\n</p>\n<p>\nThe uncompressed tarball has been signed using GnuPG (ID AA99442FB680B620).\nThe source code can be <a href=\"https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/stable/samba-4.25.1.tar.gz\">downloaded now</a>.\nA <a href=\"https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/patches/samba-4.25.0-4.25.1.diffs.gz\">patch against Samba 4.25.0</a> is also available.\nSee <a href=\"https://www.samba.org/samba/history/samba-4.25.1.html\">the release notes for more info</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- END: posted_news/20261023-153430.4.25.1.body.html -->\n\n<!-- BEGIN: posted_news/20261012-184143.4.24.8.body.html -->\n<h5><a name=\"4.24.8\">12 October 2026</a></h5>\n<p class=headline>Samba 4.24.8 Available for Download</p>\n<p>\nThis is the latest stable release of the Samba 4.24 release series.\n</p>\n<p>\nThe uncompressed tarball has been signed using GnuPG (ID AA99442FB680B620).\nThe source code can be <a href=\"https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/stable/samba-4.24.8.tar.gz\">downloaded now</a>.\nA <a href=\"https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/patches/samba-4.24.7-4.24.8.diffs.gz\">patch against Samba 4.24.7</a> is also available.\nSee <a href=\"https://www.samba.org/samba/history/samba-4.24.8.html\">the release notes for more info</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- END: posted_news/20261012-184143.4.24.8.body.html -->\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p id=\"furtherNews\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/samba/latest_news.html\">Further News &gt;&gt;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/samba/news.atom\"><img align=\"right\" src=\"/samba/rss_small.png\" alt=\"RSS-Feed\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxBottom\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBox\" id=\"specialBoxInternational\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxContent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>International Sites</h4>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<span class=\"label\">Deutsch:</span><a href=\"http://samba.sernet.de/\" target=\"_blank\">samba.sernet.de</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxBottom\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t-->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBox\" id=\"specialBoxRelated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxContent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Related Sites</h4>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://cwrap.org/\">cwrap.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//linux-cifs.samba.org/\">linux-cifs.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//talloc.samba.org/\">talloc.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//tevent.samba.org/\">tevent.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//tdb.samba.org/\">tdb.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//ldb.samba.org/\">ldb.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//rsync.samba.org/\">rsync.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//ccache.samba.org/\">ccache.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"//ctdb.samba.org/\">ctdb.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<li><a href=\"//ppp.samba.org/\">ppp.samba.org</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"specialBoxBottom\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearing\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- footer -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"noPrint\" id=\"ft\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearing\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- some JavaScript to style the layouts of some boxes (required for the start page only) -->\n\t\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\t\t\t// make sure both boxes in #mainStart have the same height\n\t\t\tfunction fixMainBoxHeight() {\n\t\t\t\tvar releases = document.getElementById('mainBoxReleases');\n\t\t\t\tvar beyondSamba = document.getElementById('mainBoxBeyondSamba');\n\n\t\t\t\tif (releases.offsetHeight > beyondSamba.offsetHeight) {\n\t\t\t\t\tbeyondSamba.style.height = '' + (releases.offsetHeight - 24)+ 'px';\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\telse if (releases.offsetHeight < beyondSamba.offsetHeight) {\n\t\t\t\t\treleases.style.height = '' + (beyondSamba.offsetHeight - 24) + 'px';\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t// move #sitemap downwards if #special ends below #sitemap\n\t\t\tfunction fixSitemapPosition() {\n\t\t\t\tvar mainStart = document.getElementById('mainStart');\n\t\t\t\tvar sitemap = document.getElementById('sitemap');\n\t\t\t\tvar special = document.getElementById('special');\n\n\t\t\t\tif (special.offsetHeight > mainStart.offsetHeight + sitemap.offsetHeight) {\n\t\t\t\t\tsitemap.style.marginTop = '' + (special.offsetHeight - mainStart.offsetHeight - sitemap.offsetHeight - 13) + 'px';\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\twindow.setTimeout(function() {\n\t\t\t\tfixMainBoxHeight();\n\t\t\t\tfixSitemapPosition();\n\t\t\t}, 50);\n\t\t</script>\n\t</body>\n</html>\n",
